  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1492/807/javaw_gwd4nirndd-ezgif.gif\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">這個模組為你的世界添加了可馴服的獅子。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以在稀樹草原生態系中找到牠們。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">（在 Forge 中，你可以透過編輯 data 資料夾中的 biome tags 和 biome modifier 檔案，</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">或使用資源包來調整此項及其他生成設定；</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">在 Fabric 中則有對應的設定檔。）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以用任何食物來馴服牠們（每次嘗試有 10% 機率成功）。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">若未馴服，牠們有時會攻擊周圍的生物，但母獅不會。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">當獅子咆哮時，除了其他獅子外，附近的生物都會試圖逃跑。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">牠們還會從地上撿拾肉類和魚類食物來食用，藉此恢復生命值。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">休息和攻擊行為也會稍微恢復生命值。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">只有公獅和母獅可以繁殖，而幼獅不會有鬃毛。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">幼獅會跟隨成年獅子，母獅則會跟隨公獅。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">公獅有 15 種身體顏色變體，母獅則因無鬃毛而有 5 種，</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">同時也有眼睛顏色變體。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">牠們有三種行為模式（<strong>aquarius libs 1.0.1 及以上版本</strong>會在主人切換行為時顯示訊息）：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 遊蕩（四處走動。若已馴服，會在設定為遊蕩模式的方塊周圍活動）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 休息（待在原地）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 跟隨（跟隨主人）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.4 | 1.20.1 | 1.18.2</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.x</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.x | 1.20.4 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f90;font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>若您需要在 CurseForge 上使用其他版本的模組，請私訊我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f90;font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>在 X（Twitter）上追蹤我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模組需要安裝 AquariusLibs</strong></a></span></p>",
